EmitReturnModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: EmitReturn — Return-block emission

    Function
        Name: EmitReturn
        Params: state, b, term
        Returns: state

    DependsOn
        EmitInstrs, EmitOperand

    Reads
        b["instrs"], term["val"]

    Writes
        state["out"]

    Behavior
        Emits the block instructions, then the return operand (term.val or null), then the RETURN opcode

    Notes
        Matches the Return handler in emit_block
